    "title": "Woman arrested on DUI charge in Westfield - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Daniel Duric ,\n3 hours ago WESTFIELD, VT — Vermont State Police arrested a woman on drunken driving charges after receiving multiple reports of erratic driving April 14. Police received several calls at 4:45 p.m. reporting a blue Saturn Outlook operating in an unsafe manner traveling north on Route 100 in Lowell and Westfield. Troopers... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
